{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>One Wellness Partner 是一個為不想再假裝自己很好的人而設的自我照顧空間，把陪伴對話、情緒與身心狀態記錄、語音日誌與睡眠作息整合在同一個程式內，讓你在被生活壓垮之前先檢視內在狀態，特別適合長期承受壓力、卻難以在主流健康資訊中找到共鳴的讀者。程式原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>不批判的陪伴與情緒記錄</h2>\n<p>One Wellness Partner 的 Tasha 以溫暖穩定的方式聆聽與反映感受，不作診斷，只陪你整理情緒。Rooted Reminders 用每日語錄卡提供腳踏實地的提醒，拒絕有毒的正能量；情緒與身心狀態記錄讓你追蹤真實狀況，逐步看出自己的模式。不想打字時可改用語音日誌，睡眠作息助你建立真正有助休息的節奏，連續記錄追蹤為每次堅持打氣。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-421-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-422-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-423-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-424-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-425-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-426-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：One Wellness Partner</li>\n<li>應用類別：Book</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-18T03:40:00.482484+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":387,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}